= **Concerns**

Sun Yat-sen is [? if sunyatsen_dead = 0 : <span style="color: #66BB6A;">alive.</span> ?][? if sunyatsen_dead = 1 : <span style="color: #d42f2f;">dead.</span> ?]

The party is [? if sunyatsen_dead = 0 and left_dissent + center_left_dissent + center_dissent + right_dissent + whampoa_dissent <= 50: <span style="color: #66BB6A;">united.</span> ?][? if sunyatsen_dead = 0 and left_dissent + center_left_dissent + center_dissent + right_dissent + whampoa_dissent > 50: <span style="color: #FFB74D;">unstable.</span> ?][? if power_struggle_active = 1 : <span style="color: #d42f2f;">breaking.</span> ?]

The <span style="color: #9e1515">Be</span><span style="color: #ab881f">iy</span><span style="color: #2587b8">a</span><span style="color: #c7c7c7">n</span><span style="color: #000000">g</span> warlords are [? if bei_strength + feng_strength < nra_strength + gmj_strength + red_strength : <span style="color: #d42f2f;">stronger than us.</span> ?] [? if bei_strength + feng_strength < nra_strength + gmj_strength + red_strength : <span style="color: #66BB6A;">weaker than us.</span> ?]

The <span style="color: #9e1515">United</span> <span style="color: #10186e">Front</span> is [? if cpc_civil_war = 0 and cpc_relation > 50 : <span style="color: #66BB6A;">strong.</span> ?][? if cpc_civil_war = 0 and cpc_relation <= 20 : <span style="color: #d42f2f;">breaking.</span> ?]
[? if cpc_civil_war = 0 and cpc_relation > 20 and cpc_relation < 50 : <span style="color: #FFB74D;">unstable.</span> ?][? if cpc_civil_war = 1 : <span style="color: #d42f2f;">over.</span> ?]









